  "body": "⭕ When a chaos token is sealed on another card you control, if Tattoos of the Void has no sealed tokens on it: Seal an identical token on Tattoos of the Void.\n【Forced】 - At the start of the round, if Tattoos of the Void has a sealed token and no other card you control has a matching token sealed on it: Take 1 horror or release the sealed token on Tattoos of the Void.",
